  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="a802e445-2efa-52c6-ba7f-ee904186ffde" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Budget is positive and at most 100000 cents; supporting evidence must be accessible to its owner.&#10;Only the active assigned reviewer decides; self-review and stale assignment completion are rejected.&#10;Persist one reasoned decision per assignment; clarification closes that assignment and preserves history.&#10;Escalate unfinished reviews after 48 hours, rechecking completion atomically.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
